# The Slow Orbit's economy, in plain GlassBox. The units are declared in inn.inn.
# Fizz, Meals and Rations are global: the ring's stores, kept in its account with Credits.
# Open is set by the phases (1 while the airlock is open).

# The fizz tanks brew another batch when the counter runs low; every bulb costs a little.
unitRule brew
    appliesTo tanks
    rate 2
    global Open atLeast 1
    global Fizz less 12
    global Credits in 0.6
    global Fizz out 1
end

# The cold store buys rations from passing freighters, a few at a time.
unitRule restock
    appliesTo locker
    rate 4
    global Rations less 8
    global Credits in 1.5
    global Rations out 3
end

# The food printer turns rations into meals while the airlock is open, and hums.
unitRule print
    appliesTo printer
    rate 3
    global Open atLeast 1
    global Meals less 10
    global Rations in 1
    global Meals out 2
    map Noise out 0.5
end

# Air scrubbers pull the CO2 out of the rooms around them, for the power they draw.
unitRule scrub
    appliesTo scrubber
    global Open atLeast 1
    global Credits in 0.05
    map CO2 in 1.2 radius 1
end

# A charging post draws power while the airlock is open.
unitRule draw
    appliesTo charger
    global Open atLeast 1
    global Credits in 0.02
end

# ---------- the new rooms' machines ----------

# The hydroponic racks grow greens for the greens counter while the airlock is open, for the
# light and the nutrient they take; the plants drink the CO2 around them.
unitRule grow
    appliesTo hydrorack
    rate 4
    global Open atLeast 1
    global Greens less 12
    global Credits in 0.4
    global Greens out 2
    map CO2 in 0.5 radius 1
end

# A gel synthesiser makes med gel for the med pods: dear stuff.
unitRule synthesise
    appliesTo gelsynth
    rate 5
    global Open atLeast 1
    global Medgel less 6
    global Credits in 2.5
    global Medgel out 2
end

# The stout synth ferments rations into Tessel stout, and gurgles.
unitRule ferment
    appliesTo vat
    rate 4
    global Open atLeast 1
    global Stout less 10
    global Rations in 1
    global Credits in 0.5
    global Stout out 3
    map Noise out 0.3
end

# A water reclaimer wrings water out of the ring's air for the steam tubs.
unitRule reclaim
    appliesTo reclaimer
    rate 3
    global Open atLeast 1
    global Water less 10
    global Credits in 0.4
    global Water out 2
end

# ---------- decor: comfort ----------

# A fern planter gives off comfort and drinks a little CO2, for nothing.
unitRule fern
    appliesTo planter
    map Comfort out 0.25 radius 1
    map CO2 in 0.15 radius 1
end

# A glow lamp draws a trickle of power at night.
unitRule glow
    appliesTo lamp
    global Open atLeast 1
    global Credits in 0.01
    map Comfort out 0.2 radius 1
end

# A starfield screen draws a little more.
unitRule starfield
    appliesTo screen
    global Open atLeast 1
    global Credits in 0.02
    map Comfort out 0.3 radius 1
end

# The drift shrine's calm reaches two cells.
unitRule calm
    appliesTo shrine
    map Comfort out 0.4 radius 2
end

# Game consoles and sim rigs draw power and hum, even idle.
unitRule hum
    appliesTo arcade simrig
    global Open atLeast 1
    global Credits in 0.03
    map Noise out 0.2
end
